0..79 Comment "//! A seat\'s dialogue with its operator: both endpoints\' moves in the one order"
80..156 Comment "//! a recorder saw them, the seat on the left following its protocol and the"
157..235 Comment "//! operator on the right following the dual. A dialogue\'s logical time is its"
236..313 Comment "//! causal web, not its log [Mazurkiewicz-1987-trace_theory]: each endpoint\'s"
314..383 Comment "//! own order and each send before its receipt. Two logs that commute"
384..463 Comment "//! independent moves are one dialogue, and `decompose` reads the web\'s modular"
464..541 Comment "//! decomposition back as data [Gallai-1967-transitiv_orientierbare_graphen]."
542..545 Comment "//!"
546..591 Comment "//! - cites: [Mazurkiewicz-1987-trace_theory]"
592..650 Comment "//! - cites: [Gallai-1967-transitiv_orientierbare_graphen]"
651..654 Comment "//!"
655..762 Comment "//! [Mazurkiewicz-1987-trace_theory]: https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-17906-2_30 \"Mazurkiewicz, Trace Theory\""
763..890 Comment "//! [Gallai-1967-transitiv_orientierbare_graphen]: https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02020961 \"Gallai, Transitiv orientierbare Graphen\""
